<title>USA: KCD to change name to SeQuester.</title>
<headline>KCD to change name to SeQuester.</headline>
<dateline>WESTLAKE VILLAGE, Calif 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>KCD Holdings Inc said it will change its name to SeQuester Holdings Inc to more accurately reflect its association with the company's major product line of dietary supplement products -- SeQuester, SeQuester2, and SeQuester3.</p>
<p>The Company's stock symbol changed from KCDH to SQST on January 31, 1997.</p>
